# Native-compile probe (task #124). The generated code is CHECKED IN now
# (task #150): `crates/celeste-names/src/gen.rs` and
# `crates/celeste-kernels/src/kernel_gen_*.rs` are committed and gated by
# `tests/generated_is_current.rs`, which regenerates them and compares. A
# build.rs cannot do that job - generating them needs the rewrite machinery
# from a crate that sits above them - and checking them in is also what
# makes a fresh clone build.
#
# Stale: the probe is a workspace member now, so it builds into /target.
# Kept so an old checkout's build dir cannot be committed by accident.
native-probe/target/

# The shape witnesses that generation reads are INPUTS, and they are
# committed too (crates/celeste-kernels/witness/) - they are dumps of a
# checkpoint frame, and checkpoints are not in git, so without them the
# kernels would have no reproducible provenance. ~95 KB, frozen.
# Scratch dumps written next to the probe are not.
/native-probe/*-shape.json
